    "turn_idx": 60,
    "turn_text": "Uh, I think, yeah, I mean, I worked really hard to keep all of those different things together. Uh, I'm, Chad just asked me about this earlier. I'm on the ballot every two years. I expect to have a convention challenge or a primary challenge and a general election challenge every two years. I mean, we would get help from the party or we won't. We, I mean, I mean, that's how it works, but we're going to keep moving forward. I don't listen, if I got fired up about everything bad that was said about me on Twitter, I probably wouldn't sleep very much. So it's I mean, there's a way to do it. You get the ballot box comes for me. I don't ever sit an election out and we'll just we'll just work forward and keep doing what we do. It's not that complicated on my end.",
