    "turn_idx": 64,
    "turn_text": "I do not. Also, I prefer states rights, and you can't have states rights if you don't have full faith in credit. And, I mean, the Supreme Court spoke on it in Oberfel, and it's one of those times where I'm going to take the vote because I think it's the constitutional thing to do, the right thing to do, and I'll take the heat for it.",
