    "turn_idx": 71,
    "turn_text": "Kelly, if you were on with us about a month or so ago, we'd be talking about debt ceiling right now. You were in the middle of that and it's sort of one of those things that I think really exemplifies how difficult it is to get things done in this country and frankly in this state. Can you talk a little bit about that process and then also What's come out of that? I mean, now there's lots of talk about House GOP not living up to the deal and the Appropriations Committee, and I don't know how much truth there is to that. But can you talk a little bit about, as somebody who's on the inside trying to actually get something done to move this country forward, how do you feel about all this?",
