    "turn_text": "mean, it's a really weird, cool thing. So it was great to have Kelly on, you know, thinking about like state parties and you talking about what do they actually do for candidates? You know, if you're Doug Berg on John Hove and Kevin Kramer, Kelly Armstrong, frankly, it's more of a nuisance. than anything else. They do more",
